<title>USA: BEC Group Inc Q3 loss includes charge.</title>
<headline>BEC Group Inc Q3 loss includes charge.</headline>
<dateline>RYE, N.Y. 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $1.28     loss	 $0.74</p>
<p> Net loss		  22,722     loss	13,059</p>
<p> Revs			16,252		   16,494</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  17,697		   17,600</p>
<p>	   9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $4.75     loss	 $0.08</p>
<p> Net profit		83,937     loss	 1,395</p>
<p> Revs			51,800		   49,896</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  17,671		   17,600</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1995 periods include $5.2 million in charges for merger relate expenses.  </p>
<p>1996 periods include a charge of $23.9 million, or $1.34 a share, in Q3 and a gain of $79.5 million, or $4.50 a share, in the nine month period for discontinued operations.</p>
<p>1995 periods include charges of $10.7 million, or $0.60 a share, in Q3 and $731,000, or $0.04 a share, in the nine month period.</p>
